# /etc/systemd/system/fleet-ipintel-fetch.timer — 每月 3 日（DB-IP 每月 1 日发布）北京时间 04:20 左右更新；错过（关机）则开机后补跑
[Unit]
Description=fleet-server ipintel: monthly offline IP database refresh

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-03 04:20:00 Asia/Shanghai
RandomizedDelaySec=30min
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
